.TH std::ranges::repeat_view::iterator 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::ranges::repeat_view::iterator \- std::ranges::repeat_view::iterator

.SH Synopsis
struct /*iterator*/;  (exposition only*)

ranges::repeat_view<W, Bound>::iterator is the type of the iterators returned by begin()
and end() of ranges::repeat_view<W, Bound>.

